{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_spst_08-05",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "spst_08-05",
  "title": "燃燒的片段5",
  "storyCode": "EG-5",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_08-05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7776496e8b05133c973643936dfac0a282103a1a4e965cbe374f7f2822986778",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "恕我冒昧，閣下就是博士吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你是......12F？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "沒想到您還記得我。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您在哪裡見過我嗎？還是說，您看過我的檔案了？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你是......？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "啊，抱歉，這是不是我們第一次見面？我還沒做自我介紹。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "博士，您好。就叫我12F吧。因為我只是個普通的行動組幹員，所以也還沒太多與您見面的機會。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別那麼客氣！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "哪裡。和我熟了以後，您說不定會討厭我。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "客氣一些，兩邊就都留著點餘地。前進一步或退後一點的餘地。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "聽說博士是個沉默寡言的人，我就不邀請您再說些什麼了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您和我的經歷可能完全不同，我們兩人的性格差異肯定很大。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不用那麼拘謹。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "出門在外我一般都會禮貌一些。習慣這種說話方式後不太好改。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "因為出言不遜導致的大打出手，我見過不少。大多時候我們對粗俗的人避而遠之，沒什麼別的原因，只是多一事可能不如少一事。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "12F",
          "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
          "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
          "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
          "text": "真是一場艱難的戰役......您居然堅持下來了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "12F",
          "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
          "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
          "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
          "text": "這樣的戰鬥只讓人覺得害怕。博士會有這種感覺嗎？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（反問他是否感到害怕）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "如果您這麼問......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "我不撒謊，是的，就算我已經跟著小隊到了這裡了，我還是挺害怕的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "在荒野上，死亡是不值一提的小事。這已經成了幾乎所有人的共識了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "我想，我們就是這麼建立了移動城市。我們想要活下去，不想再被荒野殺掉。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "但發生在這些城市間的災難向我們一再證明，每每我們自以為非常幸運地從什麼地方逃開了的時候，就會自己作弄出些新的不幸。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "切爾諾伯格的民眾能想到，自己會遭遇這些嗎？應該沒有吧。戰戰兢兢地過日子不是個好事情。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "這樣的結果太黑暗了，我無法想像自己頂著這種預見生活下去的樣子。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "但是這一切就在不知不覺中掉在了他們頭上。我們停下了核心城，那現在的切爾諾伯格裡又在發生些什麼呢？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "之後我們可能會遭遇的一切，都只讓我感到害怕。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "（習慣性沉默）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "博士既然不願多說，我也就不多問了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "（向他表述自己已經對此感到習慣這一事實）",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您習慣於什麼了？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "是習慣於害怕，還是......習慣於戰鬥？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "我有些難過。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "請放心，我不是對您有偏見......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您指的應該還是後者吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "習慣於戰鬥......有許多戰士說過類似的話。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您不是個戰士，卻已經習慣了與戰士一同出生入死。您應當是對戰鬥有所追求吧？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "還是說，這些衝突在您看來，只是您達到目標的手段......又或者每一場戰鬥中那些血腥和榮譽的部分令你感到......興奮？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "對不起，博士，對不起。我說的似乎有些過了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "只是我個人更希望博士您能夠從戰場上離開。作為戰地指揮官的您也許很有實力，甚至能和凱爾希醫生不相上下——"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "但就像凱爾希醫生一樣，我相信您如果在您原本的專業、原本的生活中投入更多精力，會給人們帶來更多好處。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "只不過事與願違吧。天真的孩子拿起武器，充滿活力的人失去性命，生活美好的人家庭破碎。我們阻止不了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "至於習慣於害怕這件事，我想，這更多說的還是我這種人。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "我很難覺得您和我是同一類型，博士。從您出現以來，您參加的這些戰鬥在我看來基本都是贏了的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您會害怕贏嗎？或者是您會害怕沒能勝利所以失去些什麼呢？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "但我根本不喜歡戰鬥。如果可以，我想逃得遠遠的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "我也許是與您截然相反的人也說不定。因為我可能連勝利都害怕。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（保持沉默）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "——"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "時候不早了。我們小隊也應該準備撤退了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "請注意安全。祝您這一天過得愉快。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "（諮詢他這麼問有何用意）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "因為我想瞭解您的為人。不過，能在這裡看到您，我差不多就能自己得出答案了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "除去曾經熟識您的那些人不說，像我這樣加入羅德島的時間不長還對您感到有些好奇的人，也挺多的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "對阿米婭，我們都有個差不多的印象，誰都知道在她那副小小的身驅下是堅韌的意志支撐著她......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "有關凱爾希醫生的看法各不相同，我倒是很能理解她，不管凱爾希醫生做什麼，她都有她的道理，她絕不衝動，從不感情用事。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "這已經不是常人能做到的事情了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "可是您......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您呢？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您回到羅德島還沒有太長時間，您的名字在您回來之前就傳開了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "但我們不知道您是誰。您是怎樣一個人？會為我們帶來些什麼？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "凱爾希醫生在您來之前就向每一台個人終端推送過消息，向我們告知，您是日後羅德島指揮部門中重要的一員。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "即使類似的人事消息很多，但我還是能注意到隱藏在這小段文字裡包含的資訊——"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "——您對於我們某些人來說是完全陌生的。反正在那時候一定是這樣。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "......我們不僅不知道您有著怎樣的過去。我們甚至不清楚您會有怎樣的未來。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "羅德島會將我們領向何方？在旅途中，您一定會扮演重要的角色。我知道，很多人這麼覺得的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "但對您自己而言呢？您會覺得這一切......不屬於您嗎？畢竟您喪失了記憶，這片大地也對您隱瞞了許多事實。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "博士，我有一些個人的經驗，能聽我說說嗎？您就聽聽，也不用當回事。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您也許覺得，自己在醒來之後沒什麼選擇的權利，一路都只是被人推著走。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "我呢，我的經驗是，從出生開始到現在，從被拋到這片大地上以後，我一直都是這種感覺。我選不了。我只能生活在這片大地上。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "除了那些覺得自己可以改變命運的偉人之外，我們這些平常人......就請允許我這麼說吧！我們這些平常人，總是被推著走的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "但我們是真的沒得選了嗎？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "這個切爾諾伯格核心城的任務，我報了名。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "我知道這很危險，也知道這和我自身的信條不符......比起做些什麼驚天動地的大事我更想活下來。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "我還很清楚自己幫不上什麼忙，比起其他更專業的幹員，我只是能勉強不拖後腿。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "但我還是這樣做了。不需要向其他人解釋什麼原因，也不需要在這件事之後再去糾結什麼。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "在做出決定以前，我們就思考過為什麼要這麼做。然後我們就是這麼做了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "所以，博士，您其實是已經有所選擇，不是嗎？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您已經和我們一起走到了這裡。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "您在這裡。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "......這就是我的結論。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "謝謝您的時間，博士。抱歉，我自說自話這麼久，但比起以前，我確實更瞭解博士您一些了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "——時候不早了，整備工作應該差不多了。我也確認了博士您的安全，接下來，我們的小隊該撤退了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "那麼羅德島見，博士。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "對了，博士......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "哪怕當時只是些微小的差別，未來也一定會隨著時間流逝，根據您選擇的不同，展露出不同的面貌。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "12F",
              "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
              "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
              "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
              "text": "我相信您一直有的選。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    }
  ],
